# SSL certificates directory
# Place your SSL certificates here:
# - app.samariaerp.org.crt (certificate file)
# - app.samariaerp.org.key (private key file)
#
# For Let's Encrypt certificates, you can mount them from the host system
# For development, you can create self-signed certificates using:
# openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \
#   -keyout app.samariaerp.org.key \
#   -out app.samariaerp.org.crt \
#   -subj "/C=ET/ST=Addis Ababa/L=Addis Ababa/O=Samaria ERP/CN=app.samariaerp.org"